00:19:08,564 --> 00:19:11,525
I BET YOU THOUGHT
IT WOULD BE WEIRD...

494
00:19:11,567 --> 00:19:13,319
BUT IT'S NOT.

495
00:19:18,074 --> 00:19:20,409
OKAY.

496
00:19:20,451 --> 00:19:23,079
SO, WELL, I'LL, UM...

497
00:19:23,121 --> 00:19:24,747
I'LL HAVE HER
HOME BY MIDNIGHT.

498
00:19:25,915 --> 00:19:30,336
( forced laughter )

499
00:19:30,377 --> 00:19:32,588
( crying )

500
00:19:43,766 --> 00:19:47,603
WHY AREN'T YOU HOME YET?

501
00:19:47,645 --> 00:19:48,896
Monica:
IS SOMEONE THERE?

502
00:19:50,272 --> 00:19:52,232
OH, YEAH, IT'S ME.

503
00:19:52,274 --> 00:19:53,567
SORRY.

504
00:19:53,609 --> 00:19:55,111
Chandler:
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

505
00:19:56,612 --> 00:19:57,864
UH, I'M JUST...

506
00:19:57,905 --> 00:20:00,366
I'M JUST LOOKING OUT
YOUR WINDOW...

507
00:20:00,407 --> 00:20:01,575
AT THE VIEW.

508
00:20:01,617 --> 00:20:03,828
WHAT ARE YOU GUYS DOING?

509
00:20:05,121 --> 00:20:07,206
WE GOT SOME VAPO-RUB
IN SOME PLACES.

510
00:20:10,126 --> 00:20:12,294
OH!

511
00:20:12,336 --> 00:20:15,339
OH, HE BROUGHT HER
BACK TO HIS APARTMENT.

512
00:20:15,381 --> 00:20:17,216
WHO?

513
00:20:21,679 --> 00:20:23,472
IS THAT YOUR SISTER?

514
00:20:23,514 --> 00:20:27,685
OH, SHE IS A SLUT!

515
00:20:27,727 --> 00:20:29,020
OH, MY GOD.

516
00:20:29,062 --> 00:20:30,479
ROSS IS ON A DATE
WITH YOUR SISTER?

517
00:20:30,521 --> 00:20:31,605
HOW WEIRD IS THAT?

518
00:20:31,647 --> 00:20:32,857
OH, MY GOD, LOOK, LOOK.

519
00:20:32,899 --> 00:20:34,400
HE'S TAKING OFF HER CLOTHES.

520
00:20:34,441 --> 00:20:37,028
HE'S TAKING OFF
HER COAT.

521
00:20:37,070 --> 00:20:39,446
Rachel:
OH, THIS IS JUST TERRIBLE.

522
00:20:39,488 --> 00:20:41,240
OH, NO, IT'S NOT.
IT'S A FIRST DATE.

523
00:20:41,281 --> 00:20:42,867
I'M SURE THAT NOTHING
IS GOING TO...

524
00:20:46,537 --> 00:20:48,748
OH!

525
00:20:50,083 --> 00:20:51,250
OOH-HOO...

526
00:20:51,291 --> 00:20:52,960
HE'S GOING TO GET SOME.

527
00:20:55,129 --> 00:20:58,298
OF THE GLARE...

528
00:20:58,340 --> 00:21:01,094
FROM THE STREETLIGHT...
OUT OF HIS APARTMENT.

529
00:21:01,135 --> 00:21:04,931
YOU KNOW, SO, UM...
HE'S CLOSED THE DRAPES THERE

530
00:21:04,972 --> 00:21:08,809
SO HE CAN HAVE A NICE,
PLEASANT CONVERSATION

531
00:21:08,851 --> 00:21:11,020
WITH YOUR LITTLE SISTER.

532
00:21:11,062 --> 00:21:13,689
WELL, I'M OFF TO BED.

533
00:21:33,084 --> 00:21:36,378
